    "rotowire": {
      "headline": "The Panthers placed Brazzell (knee) on injured reserve Friday.",
      "story": "Brazzell will officially miss his entire rookie season due to the LCL tear he suffered during Wednesday's training camp practice. The rookie third-round pick will undergo surgery and set his full attention on making a recovery for the 2027 campaign. In the wake of this transaction, Xavier Legette and John Metchie are the top candidates to secure the No. 3 wide receiver role in Carolina behind Tetairoa McMillan and Jalen Coker.",
      "description": "The Panthers placed Brazzell (knee) on injured reserve Friday.",
